Subject: [PATCH 3/8] test(sim): pin E2a's CutFromBelow refusal on a flipped
 bake before the up-march replaces it

A flipped bake (#779) marks itself bounded_cuts so a floor a cut came
within a cell of refuses by name instead of reading the shell's floor
by the monotone law, which only covers cuts from above. The review of
PR #784 asked for a direct pin of that interim law before #780's
march_up reads cut_downs; this is it, with the upright bake's unchanged
law pinned beside it.

